Package: solareclipser
Title: R Interface to 'SOLAR-Eclipse' Heritability Analysis
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: 
    person("William",
           "Burroughs",
           email = "wilbura009@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Maintainer: William Burroughs <wilbura009@gmail.com>
Description: An R interface to the Fast Permutation Heritability Inference
    (FPHI) analysis of 'SOLAR-Eclipse', ported from its C++ and Fortran
    source. Loads an empirical kinship pedigree and a phenotype file, adjusts
    a trait for covariates, and estimates its heritability (h2r) with
    standard errors and a likelihood ratio test, returning the results as
    data frames. Results can also be written in the format of the original
    'SOLAR' fphi command. See <https://solar-eclipse-genetics.org> for more
    information about 'SOLAR'.
License: GPL (>= 3)
SystemRequirements: a Fortran compiler, zlib (e.g. zlib1g-dev on Debian/Ubuntu,
    zlib-devel on Fedora/RHEL)
Encoding: UTF-8
